        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "perf(subagent-registry): replace full-table scans with scoped indexed queries",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nThe `listSubagentRunsForController` hot path loads the **entire persisted subagent registry** (all rows from SQLite via `getSubagentRunsSnapshotForRead`) and performs synchronous `Array.filter()` scanning, blocking the event loop linearly with registry size. The SQLite schema already has `idx_subagent_runs_controller_session_key` but the store layer never uses it.\n\n## What This PR Does\n\n1. **Store layer** — Added `loadSubagentRunsForControllerFromSqlite`: a scoped Kysely query that uses the existing `idx_subagent_runs_controller_session_key` index with a compound predicate preserving the `controllerSessionKey || requesterSessionKey` fallback semantics. Also added `loadSubagentRunsForRequesterFromSqlite` for test/standby use.\n2. **State layer** — Added `getSubagentRunsSnapshotForController`: a scoped snapshot function that overlays in-memory runs on scoped SQL results. **Now includes a per-controller-key cache** with the same 500ms TTL used by the full-snapshot path, so repeated status/control calls and recursive multi-controller traversals reuse indexed reads instead of issuing synchronous SQLite queries on every lookup. Cache entries are invalidated on `persistSubagentRunsToDisk`.\n3. **Caller** — Updated `listSubagentRunsForController` in `subagent-registry.ts` and `subagent-registry-read.ts` to use the scoped snapshot. The `listSubagentRunsForRequester` path is **unchanged**.\n4. **Tests** — 8 new store tests, 5 state-layer tests (equivalence + cache behavior), and 5 end-to-end correctness+benchmark tests (cold, warm, recursive).\n\nNo schema migration required — all needed indexes already exist.\n\n## Evidence\n\n### Benchmark results (10K records, ext4 SSD, Windows x64)\n\n```\n=== Controller query cold-cache benchmark (10000 records) ===\nFull-scan (load all + filter): avg=290.75ms\nScoped   (indexed query):      avg=2.14ms\nCold-cache speedup: 136.1x\n\n=== Warm repeated-call benchmark (20 calls, same key) ===\nFull-scan (global cache): total=350.50ms avg=17.52ms\nScoped   (per-key cache): total=11.18ms avg=0.56ms\nWarm speedup: 31.3x\n\n=== Recursive multi-controller benchmark (10 keys, 10000 records) ===\nFull-scan (1 hydrate + N filters): total=364.54ms avg=36.45ms\nScoped   (N indexed + cache):      total=99.03ms avg=9.90ms\nRecursive speedup: 3.7x\n```\n\nThe scoped path with per-key caching **strictly dominates** the full-scan approach across all workloads: cold (136x), warm repeated (31x), and recursive multi-controller (3.7x).\n\n### Benchmark reproducer\n\n```bash\npnpm vitest run src/agents/subagent-registry-scoped.bench.test.ts\n```\n\n### Correctness\n\n- Scoped controller snapshot produces **identical results** to filtering the full snapshot\n- In-memory record overlay preserves the same `controllerSessionKey || requesterSessionKey` precedence\n- Scoped cache is invalidated on persist, ensuring consumers see fresh data after writes\n\n### Tests\n\n```bash\npnpm test src/agents/subagent-registry-state.test.ts\npnpm test src/agents/subagent-registry.store.sqlite.test.ts\npnpm test src/agents/subagent-registry.test.ts\npnpm test src/agents/subagent-registry-scoped.bench.test.ts\npnpm test src/agents/subagent-registry-read-context.test.ts\npnpm test src/auto-reply/reply/commands-subagents-status.test.ts\n```\n\n**268/268 passing, 0 failures, 0 regressions.**\n\n### Files changed (8 files, +806/-5)\n\n| File | Change |\n|------|--------|\n| `src/agents/subagent-registry.store.sqlite.ts` | +71: 2 scoped query functions |\n| `src/agents/subagent-registry-state.ts` | +133: 2 scoped snapshot functions + per-key cache |\n| `src/agents/subagent-registry.ts` | +10/-4: DI surface + controller caller |\n| `src/agents/subagent-registry-read.ts` | +7/-1: controller caller |\n| `src/agents/subagent-registry.store.sqlite.test.ts` | +131: 8 store test cases |\n| `src/agents/subagent-registry-state.test.ts` | +144: 5 equivalence + cache tests |\n| `src/agents/subagent-registry.test.ts` | +12/-19: mock surface update |\n| `src/agents/subagent-registry-scoped.bench.test.ts` | +305: 5 e2e benchmarks (new file) |\n\nFixes #105423.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
